{"title":"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 45","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_45&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A check is written for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> dollars and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> cents, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> both two-digit numbers. In error it is cashed for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> dollars and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> cents, the incorrect amount exceeding the correct amount by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/5/8c54379a8ce892382b80029bb879179c627bf25f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$&amp;#036;17.82$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />. Then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/9/e19d8de2614eccd08303213b75c9bb8ef1a9f183.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ {x}\\text{ cannot exceed }{70}\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(B)}\\ {y}\\text{ can equal }{2x}\\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{the amount of the check cannot be a multiple of }{5}\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{the incorrect amount can equal twice the correct amount}\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{the sum of the digits of the correct amount is divisible by }{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"466\" height=\"96\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_45&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The correct total number of cents is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/e/4eebee6dee491c03c27e82d84f168a89d3970340.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100x+y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"17\" />. Due to the error, it is cashed <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/f/b6f3b09ae225d39f77278ba0b9ce5cacdff0f256.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100y+x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"17\" /> cents. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/8/8486cb24b716bbdcc0ca8e5c00709c2458028e89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100y+x-100x-y=1782$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"224\" height=\"17\" />. Simplifying, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/7/547d84616b1f24d960c8b71911b5528d7a10bb95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y-x=18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />. Looking at the answer choices:\n</p><p>A:  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/1/1f10aaaed669488039b43bc6eb9453cbf65435f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=89, x=71$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"17\" /> is a counterexample\n</p><p>B:  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/0/e30f746fc5f15a218351a0fbf31ab5d7e206b8b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=36, x=18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"17\" />, correct.\n</p><p>C:  As long as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is a multiple of 5, the original amount is a multiple of 5. A counterexample is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/b/ffb771a0dcd7854dbee4a5e27a09265bed34d7bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=15, y=33$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>D:  Then the correct amount is 17.82, and the incorrect amount is 35.64. Obviously incorrect.\n</p><p>E:  This is not fixed. A counterexample is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/6/49619628435e507870bef81cfc448ffa79c9b40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=11,y=29$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, the correct answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/3/d730ee7e2ef569768a1a2afb36b120ea511492b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ {y}\\text{ can equal }{2x}\\qquad\\\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"156\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>--Ethanol 2012\n</p><p>btw please point out any mistakes I made cuz it's the first time I made a solution\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_45&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\